  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Xeri. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Xeri (Ξερή, 'dry') is a popular Greek fishing card game. 2 or 4 players. 52 cards. 6 each + 4 face-up on table. Match rank to capture entire pile. Jack captures any pile. 'Xeri' = capturing lone card (10pts bonus, Jack Xeri = 20pts). Score: most cards=3pts, A/K/Q/J/10=1pt each, 10♦=1pt extra, 2♣=1pt.",
    objective: 'Collect the most points by capturing cards from the table; win each round by scoring the majority of points (cards, face values, good 10, good 2, and xeri bonuses).',
    gameplay: 'Play card. Match rank = capture entire pile. Jack = capture any pile. Xeri = capture lone card (bonus 10pts; Jack Xeri = 20pts). Redeal 6 when hands empty. Last capturer gets remaining cards.',
